    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sheep is a puzzle-solving escapade through crazy mazes starring those most loveable of all creatures... Sheep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unbeknownst to everyone, these seemingly dim-witted animals are actually highly intelligent beings from another planet. Over millions of years, the lush green pastures and the Human's lazy nature have caused them to lose sight of their vastly superior status and become the mindless creatures we know today. Lost, alone, and now quite dumb, they need you to reunite them with their celestial ancestors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from the four unlikely heroes: Bo Peep, Adam Halfpint, Motley or Shep, to help herd the sheep through dangerous perils.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the fate of four different breeds of sheep: Pastoral, Factoral,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Longwool, as well as Neo-Genetic, and protect them from Mr. Pear and his evil henchcows!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide your flock through seven worlds and 28 levels, including amusement parks and disco clubs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all of the golden sheep to gain access to a bonus level in each world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incredible A.S. (Artificial Stupidity) actually simulates the unique folly of sheep.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mind-challenging puzzles combined with mentally challenged sheep provide hours of enjoyment.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sheep is a puzzle-solving escapade through crazy mazes starring those most loveable of all creatures... Sheep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unbeknownst to everyone, these seemingly dim-witted animals are actually highly intelligent beings from another planet. Over millions of years, the lush green pastures and the Human's lazy nature have caused them to lose sight of their vastly superior status and become the mindless creatures we know today. Lost, alone, and now quite dumb, they need you to reunite them with their celestial ancestors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from the four unlikely heroes: Bo Peep, Adam Halfpint, Motley or Shep, to help herd the sheep through dangerous perils.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the fate of four different breeds of sheep: Pastoral, Factoral,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Longwool, as well as Neo-Genetic, and protect them from Mr. Pear and his evil henchcows!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide your flock through seven worlds and 28 levels, including amusement parks and disco clubs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all of the golden sheep to gain access to a bonus level in each world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incredible A.S. (Artificial Stupidity) actually simulates the unique folly of sheep.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mind-challenging puzzles combined with mentally challenged sheep provide hours of enjoyment.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this Lemmings-inspired game, your goal is to herd sheep across 28 hazard-filled levels so they can be rescued by their educated alien cousins. You herd four breeds of sheep and have to protect them from the evil mr. Pear.",
